    "AWS checks that a real person is present and that the face matches your photo. This uses facial biometric analysis. Supabase saves the verification result and photo version, not the video or face features." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AWS checks that a real person is present and that the face matches your photo. This uses facial biometric analysis. Supabase saves the verification result and photo version, not the video or face features."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AWS controleert of er een echt persoon aanwezig is en of het gezicht overeenkomt met je foto. Hiervoor wordt biometrische gezichtsanalyse gebruikt. Supabase bewaart de verificatie-uitslag en fotoversie, niet de video of gezichtskenmerken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AWS checks your live video to confirm you’re real and look like your photo, using face biometrics. We only keep the result, not the video or your face data." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AWS checks your live video to confirm you’re real and look like your photo, using face biometrics. We only keep the result, not the video or your face data."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AWS controleert met je livevideo of je echt bent en op je foto lijkt, met gezichtsbiometrie. Wij bewaren alleen de uitkomst, niet de video of je gezichtsgegevens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
