    "Direct and results-driven. You decide quickly, like a challenge and take charge when things need to move." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Direct and results-driven. You decide quickly, like a challenge and take charge when things need to move."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Direct en resultaatgericht. Je beslist snel, houdt van een uitdaging en neemt de leiding als er iets moet gebeuren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DISC describes behaviour on two axes: fast-paced or steady, and task- or people-oriented. That gives four styles, and most people mix two of them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DISC describes behaviour on two axes: fast-paced or steady, and task- or people-oriented. That gives four styles, and most people mix two of them."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DISC beschrijft gedrag op twee assen: snel of bedachtzaam, en taak- of mensgericht. Dat geeft vier stijlen, en de meeste mensen combineren er twee."
          }
        }
      }
    },
