          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you choose your words carefully, or do you just say what you think?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you choose your words carefully, or do you just say what you think?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kies je je woorden zorgvuldig, of zeg je gewoon recht voor zijn raap wat je denkt?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you come alive in the evening, or are you at your best early in the morning?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you come alive in the evening, or are you at your best early in the morning?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kom je pas in de avond echt op gang, of ben je juist vroeg in de ochtend op je best?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you dress mainly for comfort, or do you put a lot of care into your style?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you dress mainly for comfort, or do you put a lot of care into your style?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kleed je je vooral comfortabel, of besteed je veel aandacht aan je stijl?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you each keep your own social life, or do you like to join each other often?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you each keep your own social life, or do you like to join each other often?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heb je liever allebei een eigen sociaal leven, of ga je graag vaak mee naar elkaars afspraken?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you easily spend money on fun things, or do you prefer to plan and save?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you easily spend money on fun things, or do you prefer to plan and save?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geef je makkelijk geld uit aan leuke dingen, of plan en spaar je liever?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you eat whatever is tasty and easy, or do you pay attention to eating healthy?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you eat whatever is tasty and easy, or do you pay attention to eating healthy?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eet je vooral wat lekker en makkelijk is, of let je bewust op gezond eten?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you find it hard to say no, or do you set your boundaries easily?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you find it hard to say no, or do you set your boundaries easily?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vind je het lastig om nee te zeggen, of geef je makkelijk je grenzen aan?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you happily let others make the plans, or do you prefer to take the lead?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you happily let others make the plans, or do you prefer to take the lead?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Laat je plannen en keuzes graag aan een ander, of neem je zelf het liefst de leiding?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you happily skip parties and festivals, or do you love going out?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you happily skip parties and festivals, or do you love going out?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sla je feestjes en festivals makkelijk over, of ga je graag en vaak uit?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you hardly follow the news, or do you keep up with it every day?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you hardly follow the news, or do you keep up with it every day?"
